<title>USA: Hughes names Austin CFO.</title>
<headline>Hughes names Austin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Electronics Corp named Roxanne Austin as chief financial officer, succeeding Charles Noski, who will leave next month to become chief financial officer of United Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>Austin, 36, currently is corporate senior vice president, treasurer and controller for Hughes Electronics. She retains the senior vice president title and will report to C. Michael Armstrong, chief executive officer and chairman of the board.</p>
<p>She will serve on the company's executive committee and be a member of the office of the chairman. Hughes Electronics is a separately traded unit of General Motors Corp</p>
